Local modifications:
- Only the runtime package `icu_sepsis` is vendored. The `icu_sepsis_helpers`
  package (MDP construction from MIMIC-III, plotting, analyses) was removed;
  BenchTWM re-implements the one helper it needs, tabular value iteration,
  with identical semantics.
- The legacy OpenAI Gym registrations and wrappers (`GymWrapper`,
  `LegacyFlattenActionWrapper`, the `*-legacy` environment IDs) were removed so
  the package depends only on Gymnasium. The Gymnasium environments
  `Sepsis/ICU-Sepsis-v1` and `Sepsis/ICU-Sepsis-v2`, their dynamics, and the
  packaged MDP assets are unchanged.
